  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bot-turn-outcome-stateless-rules",
      "impact": "breaking",
      "summary": "bot-turn-outcome.v1 runs every rule that reads only the outcome (#1375), so the device refuses a violating outcome on submit_result and the model corrects it in the same Turn. New contract-mismatch keywords: duplicate-target (a repeated delegate to, this Bot included), duplicate-local-id (create_bot), duplicate-id (cancel_routine, cancel_delegation), duplicate-member (room_call, create_room, update_room), admin-not-member (create_room), empty-update (update_routine with neither schedule nor prompt, update_bot or update_room with no field), and schedule-invalid, schedule-unreachable, schedule-beyond-horizon, tz-invalid for a schedule that checkRoutineSchedule refuses. The routine calendar moved from @byok-sdk/core to @byok-sdk/protocol: import checkRoutineSchedule, nextRoutineOccurrence, the ROUTINE_* constants and their types from @byok-sdk/protocol. Core drops them and its routine_schedule_invalid code; nextRoutineOccurrence throws the protocol RoutineScheduleError (code routine_schedule_invalid) instead of ByokCoreError. A repeated daysOfWeek day is schedule_invalid instead of being merged. A routine already stored with a repeated weekday (for example by the byok-mcp-server example) throws RoutineScheduleError when its next occurrence is computed: update it to distinct days before the upgrade. The schedule fragment has one closed shape without the oneOf: RoutineScheduleShape and the scheduleShape option are removed, and a schema over budget is schema-over-budget with no flat fallback. The room mode enum and RoomFields.mode have only 'mention'. K8 drops its apply-time copies of these rules and the delegation reason duplicate_target; the owner updateRoutine and the sealed create and reseal check an empty update and the calendar at their entry. A Host that vendors K8 copies the changed files and imports the calendar from @byok-sdk/protocol.",
      "migration": "docs/spec.md#bot-turn-outcome-fragments-and-routine-time-points",
      "items": [
        "example:bot-collaboration",
        "export:@byok-sdk/core#CORE_ERROR_CODES",
        "export:@byok-sdk/core#ROUTINE_DAYS_OF_WEEK",
        "export:@byok-sdk/core#ROUTINE_HORIZON_MS",
        "export:@byok-sdk/core#ROUTINE_MAX_NOW",
